Connected to MCP server; discovered 4 tool(s):
  - search_policy(query, k, method): Retrieve verbatim passages from official NJ public-records policy documents, with citations.
  - detect_pii(text, record_id): Identify candidate sensitive information with Microsoft Presidio.
  - propose_redactions(record_id, findings, policy_chunk_ids): Produce structured redaction recommendations for a record.
  - validate_citations(citations): Verify that cited policy chunks exist in the indexed official corpus and that excerpts are verbatim.

